WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Are your team allocating time, energy and resource to the right things?

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:13.000
Write down really clearly what you’re trying to achieve.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Then list what has to go right for you to achieve that.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.500
Decide out of those things what matters most.

5
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.500
List every project and line of effort.

6
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:36.000
Then rate how much each one helps, one critical success factor at a time.

7
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Finally, you get a one-pager explaining what to focus on first, and the questions to ask.

8
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
A graph, which shows you where your projects sit, to spark conversation.

9
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.000
And a prioritised list for you to discuss.

10
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Share it with your team, and decide together.
